  "description": "We invite you to an exhibition of university graduation comics, filled with creative passion and thought. Discover the stories unfolding at the fingertips of artists dreaming of tomorrow. A moment that will leave a deep impression on you awaits!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)\n\n*Stories included:*\n1-3. **Saeeomma** (새엄마) \\[Cheongo\\]\n4-6. **Onsil Bang Hwacho** (온실 밖 화초) \\[Bosongji\\]\n7-9. **Geurimjaui Gyocharo** (그림자의 교차로) \\[Da-Dam & Waffle Natto\\]\n10-12, **Bang Hak-Suk-je** (방학숙제) \\[Datbyeol\\]\n13-15. **Reverse Housemate** (리버스 홈메이트) \\[Kkallu\\]\n16-18. **SMASHING** \\[Jiil\\]\n19-21. **Guwonui Bit** (구원의 빛) \\[Yeong Lee\\]\n22-24. **15-beonman Deo Mannajwo!** (15번만 더 만나줘! ) \\[Oso\\]\n25-27. **Neoui Banjjok** (너의 반쪽) \\[Hongna\\]\n28-30. **Neoui Regret** (너의 리그렛) \\[U-Yeon\\]",
